ple who like korean drama or  japanese or chinese drama can find those  things to learn from so  just to  try to touch on some of the main areas  uh that influence people who are  studying these three languages they are  all worth it those are  important  centers of history of culture of people  that we want to get to know  they're all a little different they're  all well worth learning for their own  reasons  okay there you have it and i'm going to  leave  a couple of suggested videos one in  japanese one in korean or at least one  in chinese and one in  in japanese that you might want to  listen to  to get a sense  of those languages  okay bye for now
 

